<#f0f000>Movelist :</>

<#f0f000>Information:</>
Gunha has 3 meters:
The <#0000FF>Blue</> bar and <#d4af37>Gold</> bar and also the <#FF0000>Kanji meter</>
When either his <#0000FF>Blue</> bar and <#d4af37>Gold</> bar reach 0, he switches to
"Defense Mode" and cannot use his usual moveset
You need to refill the bars to be able to attack again
Filling the <#FF0000>Kanji meter</> makes it so that the <#0000FF>Blue</> and 
<#d4af37>Gold</> bars deplete more slowly and refill faster (and charging up
gives more SP as well),
so it's essential to be able to maintain "Attack mode"

He can double jump

<#f0f000>Normals:</>

Run								_F_F

Back Dash							_B_B
(Can be held)

Wake Up Dash							_F_F (On Get Up)
(Gets you to the end of the stage)
(Attack Mode only)

Wake Up Dash							_B_B (On Get Up)
(Gets you to the end of the stage)
(Attack Mode only)


Left Punch 							^LP / ^X

Right Punch 							^MP / ^Y

Low Kick							^LK / ^A

High Kick							^MK / ^B

Strong Punch 							^LP + ^MP / ^X + ^Y

Kick Upper							^LK + ^MK / ^A + ^B



Crouching Left Punch 						^LP / ^X (Crouching)

Crouching Right Punch 						^MP / ^Y (Crouching)

Crouching Low Kick						^LK / ^A (Crouching)

Crouching Sweep							^MK / ^B (Crouching)

Crouching Strong Upper 						^LP + ^MP / ^X + ^Y (Crouching)

Crouching Orbit Kick						^LK + ^MK / ^A + ^B (Crouching)


Air Left Punch 							^LP / ^X (Air)

Air Right Punch 						^MP / ^Y (Air)

Air Kick							^LK / ^A (Air)

Air Rear Kick							^MK / ^B (Air)

Air Bash 							^LP + ^MP / ^X + ^Y (Air)
(Makes the opponent bounce)

Air Downwards Drop Kick						^LK + ^MK / ^A + ^B (Air)


Headbutt Grab 							_F ^MP / _F ^Y


Charge Up							^HK / ^C
(This also refills the <#0000FF>Blue</> bar and <#d4af37>Gold</> bar)
(The bars need to be full before you can gain SP)

Aurora Guard 							^HP / ^Z
(This super armor depletes the <#0000FF>Blue</> bar very fast, 
but you can use it while attacking on ground or air)

Golden Guard							^HP / ^Z (While Charging Up)
(This super armor depletes the <#0000FF>Blue</> bar a bit more slowly,
but you can't do something else while using it)

"Overcome everything with guts!" 				^S
(Gives one <#FF0000>Kanji meter</> stroke)

Blue Guts							^LP + ^LK / ^X + ^A
(Uses up one <#FF0000>Kanji meter</> stroke to refill the
<#0000FF>Blue</> bar instantly) 
(It can be used in defense mode)

Gold Guts							^MP + ^MK / ^Y + ^B
(Uses up one <#FF0000>Kanji meter</> stroke to refill the
<#d4af37>Gold</> bar instantly) 
(It can be used in defense mode)

