Gutsy Walk							^MP / ^Y
(Does no damage but refills both <#0000FF>Blue</> and <#d4af37>Gold</> bars
instantly if you land it)

Counter Stance							^LP + ^MP / ^X + ^Y	
(Does no damage but refills both <#0000FF>Blue</> and <#d4af37>Gold</> bars
instantly if you land it)

Counter Stance							^LK + ^MK / ^A + ^B	
